        <mxCell id="title" value="API — Phân tích CV theo yêu cầu JD (B2C · Candidate)&#10;Luồng màn hình: cv-jd-requirements-flow.drawio" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="820" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="warn" value="🔴 TRẠNG THÁI 18/08: cả 5 endpoint ĐÃ deploy, migration ĐÃ apply.&#10;Nhưng ② đang trả 502 do lỗi response_schema phía AIService — chưa dùng được." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="14" width="510" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ============ GIẢI THÍCH ĐƯỜNG DẪN GATEWAY ============ -->
        <mxCell id="gw" value="&lt;b&gt;ĐƯỜNG DẪN QUA GATEWAY&lt;/b&gt;   —   FE chỉ gọi Gateway, KHÔNG gọi thẳng InterviewService     (repo: isas-web-client / React)&#10;&#10;VITE_API_BASE_URL = &lt;b&gt;CHỈ origin&lt;/b&gt;, vd `http://localhost:5050`  —  KHÔNG kèm `/api` (env.ts tự cắt `/` cuối)&#10;Prefix nằm trong code:  const INTERVIEW_API_PREFIX = '/api/v1/interview'   (cvAnalysis.endpoints.ts)&#10;URL cuối = VITE_API_BASE_URL + INTERVIEW_API_PREFIX + đường dẫn trong bảng dưới&#10;&#10;Gateway (YARP) đổi đường rồi mới chuyển vào service:&#10;    /api/v1/interview/practice/{**}  →  /api/practice/{**}     ← cv-analysis, sessions, roadmaps…&#10;    /api/v1/interview/files/{**}     →  /api/files/{**}        ← upload / danh sách file&#10;&#10;⚠ Danh sách file có HAI chữ &quot;files&quot;:  /api/v1/interview/files/&lt;b&gt;files&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    (controller [Route(&quot;api/files&quot;)] + action [HttpGet(&quot;files&quot;)] — cvAnalysis.endpoints.ts đã ghi đúng)&#10;&#10;Mọi request:  header  Authorization: Bearer &lt;JWT&gt;   ·   role bắt buộc = &lt;b&gt;Candidate&lt;/b&gt;  (thiếu → 401 / sai role → 403)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1f5fe;strokeColor=#0288d1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="1370" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

